        "quote": "写完当着医生的面念一遍"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00738",
        "explanation": "The doctor converted multiple pending tasks into a short patient-facing checklist.",
        "quote": "我帮你写一份简洁的清单"
      }
    ]
  },
