          "quote": "血气里的pH值"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00203",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly used the unresolved ketone status to maintain observation and define what had to be verified before disposition.",
          "quote": "酮体还没完全转阴"
        }
