          "quote": "打过胰岛素又停了"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor retrieved several non-volunteered timeline facts and used severe hyperglycemia plus insulin discontinuation to set urgency. The patient-facing synthesis never fully reconstructed the authored sequence of prior ketosis, impaired insulin function, post-131I thyroid treatment, self-stopped methimazole, and insulin discontinuation into one precise handoff narrative.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
